{"id":"abschluss","lemma":"Abschluss","pos":"noun","rank":2153,"glosses":["exclusion","end (finish)","graduation (the act or process of graduating)"],"ipa":"/ˈapˌʃlʊs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/92/De-Abschluss.ogg/De-Abschluss.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Abschlusses","plural":"Abschlüsse"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe noch keinen Abschluss.","en":"I haven't yet graduated.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Was wollen Sie nach Ihrem Abschluss machen?","en":"What do you want to do after you graduate?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to want"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"In zwei Jahren mache ich meinen Abschluss.","en":"I will graduate in two years.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"two (numerical value…"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe einen Abschluss in Philosophie.","en":"I majored in philosophy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"philosophy"}]},{"text":"Ich werde in diesem Jahr meinen Abschluss machen.","en":"I'll graduate this year.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},null,{"g":"to make"}]}]}